{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surge Point</strong> is a fast-paced, single-player FPS roguelike with deep weapon customization and high-mobility combat. Inspired by classics like <i>DOOM</i> and <i>Quake</i>, it throws you into a simulated arena filled with deadly robotic enemies, thousands of weapon combinations and tons of unique wave mutators. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Weapons, Built Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no pre-made guns, just you and your arsenal of parts. Find components during your run and snap them together to create the ultimate weapon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barrels, bodies, mags, stocks, sights, and grips that directly impact fire rate, accuracy, damage, reload time, bullet velocity, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special ammo types like explosive rounds, bouncing shots, and tracer fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time part swapping lets you adapt your weapon to every new threat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.poster.avif?t=1768264551\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.webm?t=1768264551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.mp4?t=1768264551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Fluid Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn\u2019t just about firepower it\u2019s about speed, agility, and style. Surge Point\u2019s movement system rewards creative play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic FPS controls (run, jump, strafe) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun recoil propels you backward, master it to dodge, reposition, or launch yourself through the air</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deployable holo cubes create temporary platforms for aerial maneuvers and tactical positioning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/4977506637abc17ba48ff38bb80f1389.poster.avif?t=1768264551\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/4977506637abc17ba48ff38bb80f1389.webm?t=1768264551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/4977506637abc17ba48ff38bb80f1389.mp4?t=1768264551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342130?t=1768264551","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342130?t=1768264551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/dcc1a557a11f2cd1074fa677d3a01adf7a489463/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768264551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/dcc1a557a11f2cd1074fa677d3a01adf7a489463/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768264551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Surge Point contains frequent, stylized violence against robotic enemies. Combat includes gunfire, explosions, and fast-paced action, but there is no blood, gore, or dismemberment. The game does not contain sexual content, strong language, depictions of drug or alcohol use, or any narrative themes involving abuse or self-harm."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surge Point</strong> is a fast-paced, single-player FPS roguelike with deep weapon customization and high-mobility combat. Inspired by classics like <i>DOOM</i> and <i>Quake</i>, it throws you into a simulated arena filled with deadly robotic enemies, thousands of weapon combinations and tons of unique wave mutators. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Weapons, Built Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no pre-made guns, just you and your arsenal of parts. Find components during your run and snap them together to create the ultimate weapon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barrels, bodies, mags, stocks, sights, and grips that directly impact fire rate, accuracy, damage, reload time, bullet velocity, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special ammo types like explosive rounds, bouncing shots, and tracer fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time part swapping lets you adapt your weapon to every new threat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.poster.avif?t=1768264551\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.webm?t=1768264551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.mp4?t=1768264551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Fluid Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat i